	)
	(text "Pins 39/40: 5V main supply of the RK055HDMIPI4MA0 adapter, gated on the adapter by LCM_PWR_EN (pin 32). Pin 34 = BACKLIGHT_CTL enables/dims the adapter's own LED boost (SPF-39012 U1)."
